// title: MDE KQL to detect UAC bypass of Fickle Stealer
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents
// purpose: MDE KQL to detect UAC bypass of Fickle Stealer
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/MDE%20KQL%20to%20detect%20UAC%20bypass%20of%20Fickle%20Stealer.kql
// kind: repo
// author: Steven Lim
